{"cluster_id": "C-0407", "topic": "CAS blob protocol", "target": "architecture/blob-protocol", "member_ids": ["B040-130", "B040-138"], "canonical_claim": "The v2 Payload family keeps CABL constant-offset ranged reads and replaces header_hash with header_crc32c in the guard slot while leaving payload bytes unchanged Additionally, v2 changes CasEnvelope.header_hash to header_crc32c at [86,90), with [90,94) as a zero u32, while keeping the 94-byte core", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v2.md#integrity-model", "docs/superpowers/cas/codecs_proposal_v2.md#payload-family"]}
